{"season":2027,"status":"2027 season \u2014 real fixture, 207 home-and-away games left","sims":20000,"main":"flag","group_label":"","intro":"Ladder and finals chances from simulating the home-and-away season and the top-10 finals series (wildcard round, then the final eight). Model D (team stats + players), ratings through Grand Final 2026.","proj":{"k":"w_mean","l":"Proj. wins","lo":"w_p10","hi":"w_p90","f":"num1"},"rating_note":"Points per game better (+) or worse (\u2212) than an average team on a neutral ground","extra":[{"k":"left","l":"Games left","f":"int"},{"k":"road_left","l":"Away left","f":"int"},{"k":"sos_left","l":"Remaining SOS","f":"pm1","t":"Average rating of the opponents still to play (+ = harder)"},{"k":"rating_current","l":"Old rating","f":"pm1","t":"The previous margin-only model's rating, kept for comparison"}],"model_status":"Model D (team stats + players), ratings through Grand Final 2026","cols":[{"k":"p10","l":"Finals (top 10)"},{"k":"p8","l":"Top 8","t":"Skip the wildcard round"},{"k":"p4","l":"Top 4","t":"Double chance"},{"k":"p1","l":"Minor premiers"},{"k":"pf","l":"Prelim final"},{"k":"gf","l":"Grand Final"},{"k":"flag","l":"Premiers"}],"line":{"label":"Win total","unit":"wins","min":0},"backtest_html":"<p class=\"note\">Pre-season test on every season from 2013 to 2026 (each forecast uses only the previous season): the rating's win forecast was off by 2.82 wins per team on average, versus 2.84 for 'last season's win rate, pulled halfway to average'. Against closing bookmaker odds (2012-2026, about 2,900 matches) the market has been more accurate than these ratings at every stage of the season; see the Shiv page.</p>","model_page":true,"why_links":true,"about":["Rating is model D: opponent-adjusted team ratings on 12 match stats (shots at goal, metres gained, inside-50s, clearances and others) combined with player ratings summed over each team's most recent lineup. In a test on 2019-2026 it cut margin error by 2.7% against the previous 